-- Manulife CSTD terms, Chapter 2 (Articles 12 to 17): the funeral and death benefits, the
-- critical illness benefits in three stages and the additional benefit, the comfort cash
-- coupon, the adjustment for a young child, dividends, how the coupon and dividends are paid,
-- and the maturity benefit. Articles 18 and 19 are cstd-ch2-conditions.l4; the annex lists
-- are cstd-annex-tables.l4. The two claim decisions at the end put the layers together:
-- is the event covered, then how much.

§ `Chapter 2 — Insurance benefits`
