-- src:661 | QUYỀN LỢI BẢO HIỂM

-- In every case the total benefit paid on the death of Article 12.2, or at maturity, is not
-- less than the total premiums paid. Read as a floor under the benefit those articles
-- compute, before the settlement of accounts in 12.3 and the Debt in 17(d) (fork F-C2).
