GIVEN `the benefit`         IS A NUMBER
      `total premiums paid` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Chapter 2 — the benefit` `the benefit` `, not less than the premiums paid` `total premiums paid` MEANS
    max `the benefit` `total premiums paid`

