GIVEN t IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` t MEANS
    --         Tuổi of the insured at the event               percentage
    BRANCH IF t LESS THAN 1 THEN 20%     -- from 1 month to under 1
           IF t LESS THAN 2 THEN 40%     -- from 1 to under 2
           IF t LESS THAN 3 THEN 60%     -- from 2 to under 3
           IF t LESS THAN 4 THEN 80%     -- from 3 to under 4
           OTHERWISE             100%    -- 4 or more: Article 14 does not apply

GIVEN c  IS A `The contract`
      sa IS A NUMBER
      d  IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
`14 — under` c `the sum insured` sa `as adjusted for an event on` d MEANS
    sa TIMES `14 — the percentage of the sum insured at Tuổi` (`the insured's Tuổi under` c `on` d)

§§ `Article 12 — The funeral benefit and the death benefit`
