-- src:881 | Người Được Bảo Hiểm nhỏ hơn hoặc bằng 55 (năm
-- src:882 | mươi lăm) Tuổi tại Ngày Cấp Hợp Đồng; hoặc
-- src:883 | b) Vào Ngày Kỷ Niệm Hợp Đồng Năm Hợp Đồng thứ
-- src:884 | 20 (hai mươi) trong trường hợp Người Được Bảo
-- src:886 | Hiểm lớn hơn 55 (năm mươi lăm) Tuổi vào Ngày
-- src:887 | Cấp Hợp Đồng.
GIVEN c IS A `The contract`
GIVETH A DATE
`13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` c MEANS
    IF   `the Tuổi on the anchor day` (c's `issue date`) `of someone born` (c's `insured`'s `date of birth`) AT MOST 55
    THEN `the anniversary of` c `at which the insured reaches Tuổi` 75
    ELSE `the policy anniversary` 20 `of` c

-- The coupon has arisen by the death if its day had come and the late-stage benefit had not
-- been decided before that day.
GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`12.2 — the comfort cash coupon had arisen before the death in` dc MEANS
        `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` (dc's `the contract`) AT MOST dc's `date of death`
    AND CONSIDER dc's `date the Company decided to pay the late-stage benefit`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN TRUE
        WHEN JUST l  THEN l GREATER THAN `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` (dc's `the contract`)

-- 12.2: on the insured's death while the contract is in force: (a)(i) before any decision to
-- pay the late-stage benefit and before the coupon has arisen, 200% of the sum insured at
-- the death; (a)(ii) after the coupon has arisen, 100%; (b) after a decision to pay the
-- late-stage benefit, 100%; in each case with accumulated dividends and accumulated
-- interest. A decision made on or before the day of death counts (fork F-12b).
