GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`12.2 — the percentage of the sum insured on` dc MEANS
    BRANCH IF `the late-stage benefit was decided by the death` THEN 100%
           IF `12.2 — the comfort cash coupon had arisen before the death in` dc THEN 100%
           OTHERWISE 200%
    WHERE
        `the late-stage benefit was decided by the death` MEANS
            CONSIDER dc's `date the Company decided to pay the late-stage benefit`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST l  THEN l AT MOST dc's `date of death`

GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`12.2 — the death benefit on` dc MEANS
    `Chapter 2 — the benefit`
        (    `12.2 — the percentage of the sum insured on` dc
             TIMES `14 — under` (dc's `the contract`) `the sum insured` (dc's `sum insured at the date of death`) `as adjusted for an event on` (dc's `date of death`)
         PLUS dc's `accumulated dividends`
         PLUS dc's `accumulated interest`)
        `, not less than the premiums paid` (dc's `total premiums paid`)

-- 12.3: before paying, the Company adds premiums paid after the death, without interest, and
-- deducts the Debt, the funeral benefit it advanced, and any benefit arising after the death
-- that it paid. Nothing is clawed back if the deductions exceed it (22.2).
-- src:708 | 12.3 Trước khi thanh toán Quyền lợi bảo hiểm tử vong,
-- src:709 | Công Ty sẽ:
-- src:710 | a) Cộng các khoản phí bảo hiểm đã đóng, không có lãi,
-- src:711 | được nộp sau ngày Người Được Bảo Hiểm tử vong
-- src:712 | (nếu có);
-- src:713 | b) Trừ đi:
-- src:714 | (i) Nợ (nếu có);
-- src:715 | (ii) Quyền lợi trợ cấp mai táng mà Công Ty đã thanh
-- src:716 | toán;
-- src:717 | (iii) Tất cả các quyền lợi bảo hiểm phát sinh sau thời
-- src:718 | điểm tử vong mà Công Ty đã thanh toán (nếu
-- src:719 | có) không tính lãi.
GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`12.3 — the death benefit settled on` dc MEANS
    max 0 (    `12.2 — the death benefit on` dc
          PLUS dc's `premiums paid after the date of death`
          MINUS dc's `the debt`
          MINUS dc's `funeral benefit already paid`
          MINUS dc's `benefits arising after the death already paid`)

-- 16.4: comfort cash coupons and interest left with the Company are paid on the death as
-- well, whatever else is paid (12.2 itself does not include them). Accumulated dividends are
-- already in 12.2 and are not paid twice (fork F-16.4).
