-- src:994 | chưa trả (nếu có) sẽ được chi trả không phụ thuộc vào
-- src:995 | (các) quyền lợi mà Công Ty chi trả khi Người Được Bảo
-- src:996 | Hiểm tử vong hoặc khi Hợp Đồng bị hủy ngang hoặc khi
-- src:997 | Hợp Đồng đáo hạn.
GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`16.4 — the coupons and interest also paid on the death in` dc MEANS
    dc's `comfort cash coupons and interest held`

§§§ `The decision on a death claim`

DECLARE `An answer on a death claim` IS ONE OF
    `the death benefit, settled` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `the payment on a death excluded by Article 19.1` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
                                                          `the exclusions` IS A LIST OF `An exclusion of Article 19.1`
    `nothing: the contract was not in force at the death`

GIVEN dc IS A `A death claim`
GIVETH AN `An answer on a death claim`
`the answer on the death claim` dc MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (dc's `the contract in force at the date of death`)
            THEN `nothing: the contract was not in force at the death`
        IF NOT (null `the exclusions`)
            THEN `the payment on a death excluded by Article 19.1`
                    (`19.1 — the payment on an excluded death: the greater of` (dc's `surrender value at the date of death`)
                        `and` (dc's `total premiums paid`)
                        `less` (dc's `benefits paid under the contract before the death` PLUS dc's `the debt`))
                    `the exclusions`
        OTHERWISE `the death benefit, settled` (`12.3 — the death benefit settled on` dc)
    WHERE
        `the exclusions` MEANS `19.1 — under` (dc's `the contract`) `the exclusions the cause` (dc's `the cause`) `falls in`

§§ `Article 13 — The critical illness benefits`
