DECLARE `A benefit of Article 13` IS ONE OF
    `the early-stage benefit (13.1)`
    `the middle-stage benefit (13.2)`
    `the late-stage benefit (13.3)`
    `the additional benefit (13.4)`

-- 13.1(a), 13.2(a), 13.3(a): a condition of the early-, middle- or late-stage list of Annex
-- 1; 13.4: a condition of Annex 2 or Annex 3.
