§§§ `13.1(b) to 13.3(b) The three stages: how often`

-- 13.1(b): at most four early-stage payments over the term of the critical illness benefit,
-- one per condition; of two diagnosed the same day or at the same medical visit, only one;
-- one per paired organ. 13.2(b): the same, with two payments. 13.3(b): one late-stage
-- payment; the same-day and paired-organ limbs restate it.
