DECLARE `A limit of Article 13` IS ONE OF
    `the number of payments for the stage is used up`
    `this condition has already been paid at this stage`
    `a condition diagnosed the same day or at the same visit has been paid at this stage`
    `this paired organ has already been paid at this stage`

GIVEN b IS A `A benefit of Article 13`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`13(b)(i) — the most payments of` b MEANS
    CONSIDER b
    WHEN `the early-stage benefit (13.1)`  THEN 4
    WHEN `the middle-stage benefit (13.2)` THEN 2
    OTHERWISE 1

GIVEN b       IS A `A benefit of Article 13`
      d       IS A `A diagnosis`
      earlier IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A limit of Article 13`
`13(b) — the limits that stop` b `on` d `, given the earlier payments at the stage` earlier MEANS
    filter (GIVEN x YIELD `applies` x)
        (LIST `the number of payments for the stage is used up`,
              `this condition has already been paid at this stage`,
              `a condition diagnosed the same day or at the same visit has been paid at this stage`,
              `this paired organ has already been paid at this stage`)
    WHERE
        `applies` x MEANS
            CONSIDER x
            WHEN `the number of payments for the stage is used up` THEN
                count earlier AT LEAST `13(b)(i) — the most payments of` b
            WHEN `this condition has already been paid at this stage` THEN
                any (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the condition` EQUALS d's `the condition`) earlier
            WHEN `a condition diagnosed the same day or at the same visit has been paid at this stage` THEN
                any (GIVEN p YIELD p's `date of diagnosis` EQUALS d's `date of diagnosis` OR p's `the visit` EQUALS d's `the visit`) earlier
            WHEN `this paired organ has already been paid at this stage` THEN
                CONSIDER d's `the paired organ`
                WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
                WHEN JUST o  THEN any (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the paired organ` EQUALS JUST o) earlier

§§§ `13.4 Who the additional benefit covers`

-- (a) an insured under 18 Tuổi diagnosed with a condition of Annex 3; (b)(i) an insured of 18
-- Tuổi or more diagnosed with a condition of Annex 2 (the list for the insured's sex), other
-- than congenital defects; (b)(ii) a child of a female insured, born while the contract was
-- in force, diagnosed with a congenital defect of Annex 2. Tuổi is the defined term on the
-- day of diagnosis, as fixed for that policy year (fork F-13.4a): which agrees with Annex 3's
-- own words that its cover runs to the day before the anniversary after the 18th birthday.
-- No age is stated for (b)(ii) (fork F-13.4b).
-- src:852 | a) Trong trường hợp Người Được Bảo Hiểm nhỏ hơn 18
-- src:853 | (mười tám) Tuổi được chẩn đoán là mắc bất kỳ Bệnh
-- src:854 | Lý Nghiêm Trọng Đối Với Trẻ Em được quy định tại
-- src:855 | Phụ Lục 3 của Hợp Đồng này; hoặc
-- src:856 | b) Trong trường hợp (i) Người Được Bảo Hiểm từ đủ 18
-- src:857 | (mười tám) Tuổi trở lên được chẩn đoán mắc bất kỳ
-- src:858 | bệnh lý theo giới tính nào được quy định tại Phụ Lục
