-- src:860 | Bảo Hiểm nữ sinh ra trong thời gian Hợp Đồng có
-- src:861 | hiệu lực được chẩn đoán mắc Dị tật bẩm sinh quy
-- src:862 | định tại Phụ lục 2 của Hợp Đồng.
-- src:863 | Để được xem xét chi trả quyền lợi nêu tại Điều 13.4.(a)
-- src:864 | hoặc 13.4.(b) trên đây, Người Được Bảo Hiểm phải ở độ
-- src:865 | Tuổi, được xác định vào ngày được chẩn đoán mắc bệnh,
-- src:866 | tương ứng nêu tại từng quyền lợi.
-- src:3279 | Quyền lợi bảo hiểm này sẽ kéo dài cho đến ngày ngay trước
-- src:3280 | ngày kỷ niệm hợp đồng sau sinh nhật lần thứ 18 của Người
-- src:3281 | được bảo hiểm.
GIVEN c IS A `The contract`
      d IS A `A diagnosis`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`13.4 — under` c `the additional benefit covers` d MEANS
    CONSIDER (`the listing of` (d's `the condition`))'s `the list`
    WHEN `Annex 3, the list for children` THEN
            d's `the person diagnosed` EQUALS `the insured person`
        AND `the Tuổi at diagnosis` LESS THAN 18
    WHEN `Annex 2, the list for men` THEN
            d's `the person diagnosed` EQUALS `the insured person`
        AND c's `insured`'s `sex` EQUALS `male`
        AND `the Tuổi at diagnosis` AT LEAST 18
    WHEN `Annex 2, the list for women` THEN
        IF   d's `the condition` EQUALS `congenital defects`
        THEN     d's `the person diagnosed` EQUALS `a child of the insured born while the contract was in force`
             AND c's `insured`'s `sex` EQUALS `female`
        ELSE     d's `the person diagnosed` EQUALS `the insured person`
             AND c's `insured`'s `sex` EQUALS `female`
             AND `the Tuổi at diagnosis` AT LEAST 18
    OTHERWISE FALSE
    WHERE
        `the Tuổi at diagnosis` MEANS `the insured's Tuổi under` c `on` (d's `date of diagnosis`)

§§§ `13.5 The comfort cash coupon`

-- While the contract is in force, the insured alive and the late-stage benefit not received,
-- the coupon is 100% of the sum insured less the early- and middle-stage benefits received,
-- on the day `13.5 — the comfort cash coupon date of` gives. The document does not say what
-- follows when those benefits exceed the sum insured, which they can (four early-stage
-- payments of 25% and two middle-stage of 50%: finding X-5). Its acceptance ends the
-- benefits of 13.1 to 13.4.
-- src:871 | 13.5 Phiếu tiền mặt an nhàn
-- src:872 | Trong thời gian Hợp Đồng vẫn còn hiệu lực, Người Được
-- src:873 | Bảo Hiểm còn sống và vẫn chưa nhận Quyền lợi Bệnh
-- src:874 | Lý Nghiêm Trọng giai đoạn cuối, Công Ty sẽ thanh toán
-- src:875 | Phiếu tiền mặt an nhàn bằng 100% (một trăm phần
-- src:876 | trăm) Số Tiền Bảo Hiểm trừ đi Quyền lợi Bệnh Lý Nghiêm
-- src:877 | Trọng giai đoạn sớm và Quyền lợi Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng
-- src:878 | giai đoạn giữa đã nhận với các điều kiện sau:
-- src:888 | Quyền lợi Bệnh Lý Nghiêm Trọng quy định tại Điều 13.1,
-- src:889 | Điều 13.2, Điều 13.3 và Điều 13.4 sẽ chấm dứt khi Công
-- src:890 | Ty chấp nhận thanh toán Phiếu tiền mặt an nhàn.
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`13.5 does not say what follows when the early- and middle-stage benefits received exceed the sum insured` MEANS
    REFUSE "13.5 does not say what follows when the early- and middle-stage benefits received exceed the sum insured"

DECLARE `An answer on the comfort cash coupon` IS ONE OF
    `the coupon is` HAS `the amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no coupon: the contract is not in force, the insured has died, or the late-stage benefit was received`

GIVEN `in force`                     IS A BOOLEAN
      `alive`                        IS A BOOLEAN
      `late-stage received`          IS A BOOLEAN
      sa                             IS A NUMBER
      `early and middle received`    IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `An answer on the comfort cash coupon`
`13.5 — the coupon, in force` `in force` `, alive` `alive` `, late stage received` `late-stage received` `, on a sum insured of` sa `less` `early and middle received` MEANS
    IF   `in force` AND `alive` AND NOT `late-stage received`
    THEN IF   sa AT LEAST `early and middle received`
         THEN `the coupon is` (sa MINUS `early and middle received`)
         ELSE `13.5 does not say what follows when the early- and middle-stage benefits received exceed the sum insured`
    ELSE `no coupon: the contract is not in force, the insured has died, or the late-stage benefit was received`

§§§ `The decision on a critical illness claim`

DECLARE `A reason a critical illness claim is not paid` IS ONE OF
    `31.1: the contract was not in force at the diagnosis`
    `31.2: the benefit had ended at the anniversary at 75 Tuổi`
    `31.3: the benefit had ended on approval of the late-stage benefit`
    `13.5: the benefit had ended on approval of the comfort cash coupon`
    `18(a): the condition began within the 90-day waiting period`
    `18(b): the insured did not survive 30 days from the diagnosis`
    `19.2: an exclusion applies`
    `Annexes: the definition of the listed condition is not met`
    `13.4: the additional benefit does not cover this person, sex or Tuổi`
    `Annex 1: barred by a claim for another condition`
    `Annex 1: barred by a payment for another condition`
    `13(b): a limit on the number or kind of payments applies`
    `13.4: the additional benefit has already been paid`

DECLARE `An answer on a critical illness claim` IS ONE OF
    `payable` HAS `the benefit` IS A `A benefit of Article 13`
                  `the amount`  IS A NUMBER
    `not payable` HAS `the reason` IS A `A reason a critical illness claim is not paid`

-- The late-stage approval among the earlier payments, if any.
GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`the approval of a late-stage benefit among` ps MEANS
    CONSIDER filter (GIVEN p YIELD `13 — the benefit that answers` (p's `the condition`) EQUALS `the late-stage benefit (13.3)`) ps
    WHEN EMPTY                THEN NOTHING
    WHEN p FOLLOWED BY others THEN JUST (p's `date the Company approved it`)

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
      b  IS A `A benefit of Article 13`
GIVETH A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
`the payments among` ps `of` b MEANS
    filter (GIVEN p YIELD `13 — the benefit that answers` (p's `the condition`) EQUALS b) ps

GIVEN ps IS A LIST OF `A critical illness benefit already paid`
      b  IS A `A benefit of Article 13`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount paid among` ps `of` b `for the same illness` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the amount`)
             (filter (GIVEN p YIELD p's `for the same illness as the claim`) (`the payments among` ps `of` b)))

-- The layers in the document's own order: is the benefit still running (31, 13.5); is the
-- event covered (18, 19.2, the annex definition, 13.4's persons); do the annexes' bars or
-- 13(b)'s limits stop it; then the amount, on the sum insured at the diagnosis adjusted by
-- Article 14 for a child under 4 (except 13.4(b), which Article 14 does not name).
GIVEN cl IS A `A critical illness claim`
GIVETH AN `An answer on a critical illness claim`
`the answer on the critical illness claim` cl MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (cl's `the contract in force at the date of diagnosis`)
            THEN `not payable` `31.1: the contract was not in force at the diagnosis`
        IF elem `31.2 the anniversary at which the insured reaches 75 Tuổi has come` `the grounds of 31`
            THEN `not payable` `31.2: the benefit had ended at the anniversary at 75 Tuổi`
        IF elem `31.3 the Company has approved the late-stage benefit` `the grounds of 31`
            THEN `not payable` `31.3: the benefit had ended on approval of the late-stage benefit`
        IF `the coupon was approved by the diagnosis`
            THEN `not payable` `13.5: the benefit had ended on approval of the comfort cash coupon`
        IF (NOT (`18 — the diagnosis is due to an Accident:` d)) AND (NOT (`18(a) — under` c `the waiting period is passed by` d))
            THEN `not payable` `18(a): the condition began within the 90-day waiting period`
        IF NOT (`18 — under` c `the waiting and survival periods allow` d `, the claim decided on` (cl's `date the claim is decided`))
            THEN `not payable` `18(b): the insured did not survive 30 days from the diagnosis`
        IF NOT (null (`19.2 — under` c `the exclusions the diagnosis` d `falls in`))
            THEN `not payable` `19.2: an exclusion applies`
        IF NOT (`the definition of the listed condition is met by` d)
            THEN `not payable` `Annexes: the definition of the listed condition is not met`
        IF (b EQUALS `the additional benefit (13.4)`) AND (NOT (`13.4 — under` c `the additional benefit covers` d))
            THEN `not payable` `13.4: the additional benefit does not cover this person, sex or Tuổi`
        IF `a claim for another condition bars` (d's `the condition`) `given the claims` (cl's `the conditions claimed under the contract`)
            THEN `not payable` `Annex 1: barred by a claim for another condition`
        IF `a payment for another condition bars` (d's `the condition`) `given the payments` (map (GIVEN p YIELD p's `the condition`) paid)
            THEN `not payable` `Annex 1: barred by a payment for another condition`
        IF (b EQUALS `the additional benefit (13.4)`) AND (NOT (null (`the payments among` paid `of` b)))
            THEN `not payable` `13.4: the additional benefit has already been paid`
        IF (NOT (b EQUALS `the additional benefit (13.4)`)) AND (NOT (null (`13(b) — the limits that stop` b `on` d `, given the earlier payments at the stage` (`the payments among` paid `of` b))))
            THEN `not payable` `13(b): a limit on the number or kind of payments applies`
        OTHERWISE `payable` b `the amount`
    WHERE
        c    MEANS cl's `the contract`
        d    MEANS cl's `the diagnosis`
        paid MEANS cl's `the benefits already paid`
        b    MEANS `13 — the benefit that answers` (d's `the condition`)
        `the grounds of 31` MEANS
            `31 — under` c `the grounds on which the benefit has ended by` (d's `date of diagnosis`)
                `, in force` TRUE `, the late stage approved on` (`the approval of a late-stage benefit among` paid)
        `the coupon was approved by the diagnosis` MEANS
            CONSIDER cl's `date the Company approved the comfort cash coupon`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST a  THEN a AT MOST d's `date of diagnosis`
        `the sum insured, adjusted by Article 14` MEANS
            `14 — under` c `the sum insured` (cl's `sum insured at the date of diagnosis`) `as adjusted for an event on` (d's `date of diagnosis`)
        `the amount` MEANS
            CONSIDER b
            WHEN `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` THEN
                `13.1(a) — the early-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `the sum insured, adjusted by Article 14`
                    `, with` (cl's `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts`) `paid under other contracts`
            WHEN `the middle-stage benefit (13.2)` THEN
                `13.2(a) — the middle-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `the sum insured, adjusted by Article 14`
                    `, with` (cl's `paid for this diagnosis under the insured's other contracts`) `paid under other contracts and`
                    (`the amount paid among` paid `of` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` `for the same illness`) `paid for the same illness`
            WHEN `the late-stage benefit (13.3)` THEN
                `13.3(a) — the late-stage benefit on a sum insured of` `the sum insured, adjusted by Article 14`
                    `, with` (    `the amount paid among` paid `of` `the early-stage benefit (13.1)` `for the same illness`
                              PLUS `the amount paid among` paid `of` `the middle-stage benefit (13.2)` `for the same illness`) `paid for the same illness`
            WHEN `the additional benefit (13.4)` THEN
                IF   (`the listing of` (d's `the condition`))'s `the list` EQUALS `Annex 3, the list for children`
                THEN `13.4 — the additional benefit on a sum insured of` `the sum insured, adjusted by Article 14`
                ELSE `13.4 — the additional benefit on a sum insured of` (cl's `sum insured at the date of diagnosis`)

